      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6eb5486321de474d67fbe7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如我从巨匠前辈那里学习一样，\n杏同学现在也在从那位身上汲取着什么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e336c9fcd29fdb557c8929ed32feab422dd807116b5dce6018963f0a5510067",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419ab8d670e78253a382b950",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛的世界里，这种事时有发生呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "7128f4b02a32c8c11deec8e1e1a3d8f14ed340196837506a8eff9fe5673e2cc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3605c4bcf487c3ea3815e51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de71c2cdbe52eef1bcb5e6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……就像是因果啊。\n仿佛通过咱和杏同学\n巨匠前辈她们之间也产生了联结似的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "176808d9cac9b1cc14c88ef0cc3887a7aaf2d7151135012b7d7d69cf2880430b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f9d335181941afb23140a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "评论员",
      "source_fingerprint": "d370d7d5b07c4a4699b9f2d0596e9a21fa324599b68df12ee0fb6c8835c38f8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5087e2c1984139e618c440f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先自然是她吧。\n在去年这个时间点，无论精神还是技术层面，\n她的完成度都已经出类拔萃。而且――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d28d3ea9d4319bb4c12ce025ccb1b829187d0b70f124302a14f83959a4b08084",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b09b1bb413b0fc5ab789ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跨越世代的纵向联系，在“当下”显现为因缘，\n接着比赛粉丝再从中寻得戏剧性。\n这是自古以来便在循环往复的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "480071d6c7ddcc9a45044e8c67190ca3d4d52efd129e58df39a34fa10c677e84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37bd81bd0c2963754c6e0c65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
